# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueDomain> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Valor del que todos los valores de un dominio de valores son mayores, sin alcanzarlo. Un dominio de valores tiene como mucho una cota inferior, inclusiva (hasLowerBound) o exclusiva."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Value that every value of a value domain is greater than, without reaching it. A value domain has at most one lower bound, inclusive (hasLowerBound) or exclusive."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has exclusive lower bound"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveLowerBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene cota inferior exclusiva"@es .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueDomain> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Valor del que todos los valores de un dominio de valores son menores, sin alcanzarlo. Un dominio de valores tiene como mucho una cota superior, inclusiva (hasUpperBound) o exclusiva."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Value that every value of a value domain is less than, without reaching it. A value domain has at most one upper bound, inclusive (hasUpperBound) or exclusive."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has exclusive upper bound"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasExclusiveUpperBound> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene cota superior exclusiva"@es .
