<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasCodeReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasCodeReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Clave de una implementación del componente en un programa que ejecuta metaheurísticas (p. ej. \"cometa:swap-mutation\"). Selecciona esa implementación de forma explícita; si no se indica, se usa la clase más específica del componente."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasCodeReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Key of an implementation of the component in a program that runs metaheuristics (e.g. \"cometa:swap-mutation\"). It selects that implementation explicitly; without it, the most specific class of the component is used."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasCodeReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has code reference"@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#hasCodeReference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene referencia de código"@es .
