<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Magnitud del problema cuyo valor se conoce antes de resolverlo y que caracteriza una instancia concreta del problema."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ProblemData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Problem quantity whose value is known before solving the problem and that characterizes a specific instance of it."@en .
