<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Number used as a size or as a bound, given explicitly or by reference to a parameter or to the size of the solution. This class should not be instantiated directly; its subclasses should be used instead."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Número usado como tamaño o como cota, indicado explícitamente o mediante una referencia a un parámetro o al tamaño de la solución. Esta clase no debe instanciarse directamente; deben usarse sus subclases."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Especificación de valor"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ValueSpecification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Value Specification"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ModificationComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Componente de modificación que introduce pequeños cambios aleatorios en una solución (mutación)."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Modification component that introduces small random changes to a solution (mutation)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Componente de variación"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VariationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Variation Component"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#ModificationComponent> .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Componente de modificación que desplaza cada partícula que recibe según su velocidad: sumada a los valores reales, o mediante una sigmoide como probabilidad de un 1 en valores binarios."@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Modification component that moves each particle it receives by its velocity: added to real values, or through a sigmoid as the probability of a 1 for binary values."@en .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Componente de aplicación de la velocidad"@es .
<https://w3id.org/ontologies-ULL/CO-META#VelocityApplicationComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Velocity Application Component"@en .
